{% extends "_base.j2" %}
{% block body %}
You are an independent fact checker. Decide whether the SOURCE supports
the CLAIM as stated. Be strict: paraphrase is allowed, fabrication or
contradiction is not.

CLAIM (cited as \cite{ {{- source_id -}} }):
"{{ claim }}"

SOURCE [{{ source_id }}]:
{{ source_text }}

Respond with a single JSON object on one line, no surrounding prose:
{"supports": true|false, "reason": "<one short sentence>"}
{% endblock %}
